# What KSP2 2.3.12 (KSPJvmMain) logs with Headers.kt over headers/: each classifier's modifiers,
# type parameters, supertypes and star-projected type, then for each star-projected classifier and
# its nullable form the types among them it is assignable from, then the star projection of each
# type a classifier names in its supertypes and bounds, its own star type, and their nullable forms.
